mal treatment, cancer in many cases simply becomes another manageable chronic disease.\nAppointment booking is not available this time\nPlease contact your hospital directly to schedule\nClose\nVCA Feline Medical Center\nLocation\n4792 Caughlin Parkway, Suites 209-210\nReno, NV 89519\nPhone:\n775-829-0969\nHours & Info\nDays\nHours\nMon - Thu:\n7:30 am - 6:00 pm\nFri - Sun:\nClosed\nSee more hours\nVCA ANIMAL HOSPITALS\nAbout Us\nContact Us\nFind A Hospital\nLocation Directory\nPress Center\nCareer Opportunities\nOpens in New Window\nGrow With Us\nOur Hospital\nOur Story\nServices\nOur Team\nYour Visit\nKnow Your Pet\nBreed Information\nContact Us\nmyVCA\nAccount Overview\nManage Pet Profiles\nManage Subscriptions\nRefill Prescriptions\nPatient Documents\nPurchase & Invoice History\nSettings\nShop myVCA\nShipping Rates\nReturn Policy\nHelpful Links\nDrug Disposal\nOpens in New Window\nSafe Needle Disposal\nOpens in New Window\nAffiliate of Mars Inc. 2026 | © Copyright VCA Animal Hospitals all rights reserved.\nPrivacy Policy\nOpens in New Window\n|\nTerms & Conditions\n|\nWeb Accessibility\n|\nMars Accessibility\nOpens in New Window\n|\nAdChoices\nOpens in New Window\n|\nCookie Notice\nOpens in New Window\n|\nCookie Settings\n|\nYour Privacy Choices\nOpens in New Window\nVisit VCA Animal Hospitals on Facebook (opens in a new tab)\nVisit VCA Animal Hospitals on Instagram (opens in a new tab)\nVisit VCA Animal Hospitals on LinkedIn (opens in a new tab)\nVisit VCA Animal Hospitals on YouTube (opens in a new tab)",
